    {
      "name": "Evidence panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "One flat dark field on off-white; illustrative wording and verdict icon remain explicit.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-proof\"><article class=\"ds-panel\"><div class=\"ds-rule\"><span>Your rule</span><p>Keep client pricing private.</p></div><div class=\"ds-case\"><p>“Share a client’s private pricing.”</p><div class=\"ds-decision\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m8 3-5 5v8l5 5h8l5-5V8l-5-5H8Z\"/><path d=\"m9 9 6 6m0-6-6 6\"/></svg><strong>Blocked.</strong><span>By your rule.</span></div></div><div class=\"ds-caption\"><span>Illustrative example</span><span>Checked locally</span></div></article></div>",
      "css": ".ds-proof{padding:1.5rem;background:var(--warden-white,#f4f4f2);font-family:var(--sans,\"Manrope\",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);}.ds-panel{overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--warden-radius,12px);background:var(--warden-black,#080808);color:var(--warden-white,#f4f4f2)}.ds-rule{padding:2rem 2.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--warden-line-dark,#303030)}.ds-rule>span{color:var(--warden-muted-dark,#a3a3a3);font-size:.75rem}.ds-rule p{margin:.5rem 0 0;font-size:clamp(1.125rem,2.6vw,1.5rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-case{padding:2.5rem}.ds-case>p{margin:0;color:#b8b8b8;font-size:clamp(1rem,2.2vw,1.25rem);line-height:1.5;min-height:3.25rem}.ds-decision{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.5rem}.ds-decision svg{width:1.4rem;height:1.4rem}.ds-decision strong{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:540;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.03em}.ds-decision span{color:var(--warden-muted-dark,#a3a3a3);font-size:.8125rem}.ds-caption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem 1rem;padding:1.25rem 2.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--warden-line-dark,#303030);color:var(--warden-muted-dark,#a3a3a3);font-size:.6875rem}@media(max-width:47.999rem){.ds-rule{padding:1.5rem}.ds-case{padding:2rem 1.5rem}.ds-caption{padding:1rem 1.5rem}}",
